									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-54b7a0c4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="54b7a0c4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Why a Moroccan Bath centre <span class="hl">sells authenticity, not a spa menu</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2941eafa e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2941eafa" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6914dcf1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6914dcf1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1c2cad0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1c2cad0" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Unlike a general hammam center, a Moroccan Bath centre&#8217;s whole appeal rests on a specific, named ritual — the beldi black soap, kessa exfoliation and rhassoul clay sequence — and clients specifically search for it by name, expecting to see the authentic ingredients, not just book a generic scrub.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-240fd13d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="240fd13d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The exfoliation moment is the actual content strategy</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3e9c0c08 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3e9c0c08" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>The visible, satisfying result of kessa-glove exfoliation is naturally shareable content — treating this like a standard spa service and skipping visual proof of the ritual wastes the category&#8217;s single biggest organic content advantage.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-349b77ec elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="349b77ec" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Package tiers serve genuinely different buyers</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-276ebee5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="276ebee5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A curious first-timer books the classic ritual; a repeat local wants membership pricing; a couple wants a joint occasion experience; a gift-giver wants a standalone voucher product. Marketing all four the same way undersells three of them.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-66ad63f0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="66ad63f0" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-44529aaf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="44529aaf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Moroccan Bath centres, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">AED 200-1,000</b><span>— real Dubai price range across packages</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Ingredient-led</b><span>— beldi soap &amp; rhassoul clay authenticity matters</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">4-6 wks</b><span>— typical local-client repeat cycle</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">High-shareable</b><span>— exfoliation-result content performs strongly</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
